# text = The bells of the cars as they rapidly glided by each other jingled merrily on the ear , and Clodius with smiles or nods claimed familiar acquaintance with whatever equipage was most elegant or fantastic : in fact , no idler was better known in Pompeii cried , in a pleasant and musical voice , a young man , in a chariot of the most fastidious and graceful fashion .
