# text = Thus conversing , their steps were arrested by a crowd gathered round an open space where three streets met ; and , just where the porticoes of a light and graceful temple threw their shade , there stood a young girl , with a flower-basket on her right arm , and a small three-stringed instrument of music in the left hand , to whose low and soft tones she was modulating a wild and half-barbaric air .
