# text = At every pause in the music she gracefully waved her flower-basket round , inviting the loiterers to buy ; and many a sesterce was showered into the basket , either in compliment to the music or in compassion to the songstress -- for she was blind said Glaucus , stopping THE BLIND FLOWER-GIRL'S SONG I . Buy my flowers -- O buy -- I pray !
