# text = She was dressed simply in a white tunic , which reached from the neck to the ankles ; under her arm she bore a basket of flowers , and in the other hand she held a bronze water-vase ; her features were more formed than exactly became her years , yet they were soft and feminine in their outline , and without being beautiful in themselves , they were almost made so by their beauty of expression ; there was something ineffably gentle , and you would say patient , in her aspect .
