# text = A look of resigned sorrow , of tranquil endurance , had banished the smile , but not the sweetness , from her lips ; something timid and cautious in her step -- something wandering in her eyes , led you to suspect the affliction which she had suffered from her birth -- she was blind ; but in the orbs themselves there was no visible defect -- their melancholy and subdued light was clear , cloudless , and serene said she said the Greek answered Nydia , with a blush said Glaucus , tenderly , and in the voice of a compassionate brother .
