# text = The embarrassment did not escape Arbaces ; but without seeming to heed it , he replied with a smile said Glaucus said Arbaces , with ill-suppressed emotion retorted Glaucus , playing carelessly with his chain said Ione , hastening to interrupt a conversation which she saw , to her great distress , was so little likely to cement the intimacy she had desired to effect between Glaucus and her friend Ione stopped short suddenly , and her face was suffused with the most enchanting blushes .
