# text = Here the habituated bathers , men who bathed seven times a day , would remain in a state of enervate and speechless lassitude , either before or ( mostly ) after the water-bath ; and many of these victims of the pursuit of health turned their listless eyes on the newcomers , recognizing their friends with a nod , but dreading the fatigue of conversation .
