# text = After the perfumes and the unguents , they scattered over him the luxurious powder which prevented any further accession of heat : and this being rubbed away by the smooth surface of the pumice , he began to indue , not the garments he had put off , but those more festive ones termed ' the synthesis' , with which the Romans marked their respect for the coming ceremony of supper , if rather , from its hour ( three o'clock in our measurement of time ), it might not be more fitly denominated dinner .
