# text = The gay disposition of all the Pompeians , who sought , at least , to gratify the sense even where they neglected the mind , was typified by the gaudy colors which decorated the walls , and the shapes , fantastic but not inelegant , in which the lamps , the drinking-cups , the commonest household utensils , were wrought said one of the gladiators , as he leaned against the wall of the threshold and as he spoke he slapped a portly personage on the back The man thus caressingly saluted , and whose bared arms , white apron , and keys and napkin tucked carelessly within his girdle , indicated him to be the host of the tavern , was already passed into the autumn of his years ; but his form was still so robust and athletic , that he might have shamed even the sinewy shapes beside him , save that the muscles had seeded , as it were , into flesh , that the cheeks were swelled and bloated , and the increasing stomach threw into shade the vast and massive chest which rose above it growled the gigantic landlord , in the gentle semi-roar of an insulted tiger returned the gladiator , laughing scornfully cried the host said the gladiator , coloring with rising fury said Tetraides , frowning said the gigantic Niger , stalking up to the gladiator grunted Sporus , with eyes of fire said Lydon , folding his arms , and regarding his rivals with a reckless air of defiance said the surly host said Lydon , sneeringly The Titan wine-vender seized the hand extended to him , and griped it in so stern a vice that the blood spirted from the fingers' ends over the garments of the bystanders .
