# text = ' Well , well said Stratonice , who was now employed in smoothing her hair and adjusting her dress continued Burbo , drinking off a bowl , or rather a pail of wine said Stratonice , drawing her husband to her affectionately by the ears , in that caress which Tibullus has so prettily described murmured the huge jaws of Burbo said she , whispering him was the conjugal reply ; and Burbo , satisfied with the dear assurance , strode through the apartment , and sought the penetralia of his house said Niger cried Tetraides said Lydon grunted Sporus said the athletic , thus modestly naming himself said Stratonice , as she pierced a huge amphora for her guests , who had now seated themselves before one of the tables said Lydon said Tetraides said the hostess said Niger said Stratonice said Lydon returned Stratonice cried Lydon said Sporus , impatiently echoed the grim Niger , whetting his knife on the palm of his hand .
