# text = He burst the door ; he beheld Nydia writhing in the grasp of the infuriate hag ; the cord , already dabbled with blood , was raised in the air -- it was suddenly arrested said Glaucus , and with his left hand he caught Nydia from her grasp exclaimed the flower-girl , in a tone almost of transport ; the tears stood arrested on her cheek ; she smiled , she clung to his breast , she kissed his robe as she clung said Clodius , now entering with Lepidus shrieked the virago , placing her mighty grasp on the breast of the Greek answered Glaucus said Burbo , rising reluctantly
