# text = If one moment she murmured reproaches upon Glaucus -- if one moment she renounced , she almost hated him -- at the next she burst into passionate tears , her heart yielded to its softness , and she said in the bitterness of anguish From the hour the Egyptian had left her she had retired to her most secluded chamber , she had shut out her handmaids , she had denied herself to the crowds that besieged her door .
