# text = At the sound of his voice she paused at once -- listening , blushing , breathless ; with her lips parted , her face upturned to catch the direction of the sound , she laid down the vase -- she hastened to him ; and wonderful it was to see how unerringly she threaded her dark way through the flowers , and came by the shortest path to the side of her new lord said Glaucus , tenderly stroking back her long and beautiful hair sighed the slave continued Glaucus said Nydia , clasping her hands said Glaucus
