# text = In this hope he had watched the expanding youth of the beautiful Neapolitan ; and , knowing the influence that the mind possesses over those who are taught to cultivate the mind , he had contributed willingly to form the genius and enlighten the intellect of Ione , in the hope that she would be thus able to appreciate what he felt would be his best claim to her affection : viz , a character which , however criminal and perverted , was rich in its original elements of strength and grandeur .
