# text = Although it was broad day without , the mansion , according to the practice of the luxurious , was artificially darkened , and the lamps cast their still and odor-giving light over the rich floors and ivory roofs said Arbaces , as he bent to touch her hand said Ione , smiling There was something so frank and charming in the manner of Ione , as she thus spoke , that the Egyptian was more than ever enamoured , and more than ever disposed to renew the offence he had committed ; he , however , answered quickly and gaily , and hastened to renew the conversation .
