# text = Arbaces raised his hand -- the spectre seemed to drop the mantle that concealed its form -- and Ione shrieked -- it was Arbaces himself that thus knelt before her whispered again the Egyptian's voice in her ear Ione started -- the black curtain closed over the phantasmagoria : and Arbaces himself -- the real , the living Arbaces -- was at her feet said he , passionately gazing upon her Alone , and in the power of this singular and fearful man , Ione was not yet terrified ; the respect of his language , the softness of his voice , reassured her ; and , in her own purity , she felt protection .
