# text = But she was confused -- astonished : it was some moments before she could recover the power of reply said she at length ; and she resigned to him once more her hand , which she as quickly withdrew again , when she felt upon it the burning pressure of his lips said he tenderly she added quickly , as she saw his dark eyes glitter with the fierceness of his passion said Ione , blushingly , but in a firm voice shouted Arbaces , rising to his fullest height began Ione ; and then , appalled before his sudden and unlooked-for violence , she burst into tears .
