# text = Both the antagonists were now locked in each other's grasp -- the hand of each seeking the throat of the other -- the face drawn back -- the fierce eyes flashing -- the muscles strained -- the veins swelled -- the lips apart -- the teeth set -- both were strong beyond the ordinary power of men , both animated by relentless wrath ; they coiled , they wound , around each other ; they rocked to and fro -- they swayed from end to end of their confined arena -- they uttered cries of ire and revenge -- they were now before the altar -- now at the base of the column where the struggle had commenced : they drew back for breath --
