# text = Here , if God meant this working-day life for a perpetual holiday , who would not sigh to dwell for ever -- asking nothing , hoping nothing , fearing nothing , while thy skies shine over him -- while thy seas sparkle at his feet -- while thine air brought him sweet messages from the violet and the orange -- and while the heart , resigned to -- beating with -- but one emotion , could find the lips and the eyes , which flatter it ( vanity of vanities !) that love can defy custom , and be eternal ?
