# text = In these exceptions , Apaecides noted an officer of the guard , and an Alexandrian merchant recommenced Olinthus A low and applauding murmur ran through the assembly beckoning to the old slave who had spoken third for the admission of Apaecides Useless would it be for us to accompany the lecture of Medon , or the comments of the congregation .
