# text = This lovely custom of infant initiation was long cherished by the early Church , in memory of the words which said , ' Suffer little children to come unto me , and forbid them not '; and was perhaps the origin of the superstitious calumny which ascribed to the Nazarenes the crime which the Nazarenes , when victorious , attributed to the Jew , viz . the decoying children to hideous rites , at which they were secretly immolated .
