# text = As the light of declining day seems to mingle earth and heaven , making the outline of each scarce visible , and blending the harsh mountain-tops with the sky , even so did the smile of that benign old age appear to hallow the aspect of those around , to blend together the strong distinctions of varying years , and to diffuse over infancy and manhood the light of that heaven into which it must so soon vanish and be lost said Olinthus said the old man : the throng gave way .
