# text = Julia remained a long time silent ; but her heaving breast and flashing eyes would have betrayed , to one who could have seen , the wound her vanity had sustained said she , at last breaking silence said Julia returned Nydia , timidly said the flower-girl , coloring asked Nydia answered Julia , haughtily said Nydia , eagerly replied Julia , with the customary deceit of her sex Nydia drew her breath more freely , and after a short pause Julia recommenced Alas ! no , murmured Nydia said Julia , unconscious of what was passing in the breast of the flower-girl said Nydia , shuddering replied Julia , grasping at the recollection answered Nydia ; and she felt her talisman while she spoke continued Julia , sneeringly replied Nydia said Julia , catching only the first sentence returned the wayward and pampered Pompeian Nydia did not answer resumed Julia answered Nydia , yielding to her own sudden and secret wish to learn if the dark Egyptian were indeed possessed of those spells to rivet and attract love , of which the Thessalian had so often heard said Julia , haughtily asked Nydia , anxiously answered the lady said Nydia , putting aside the bracelet returned Julia JULIA SEEKS ARBACES .
