# text = A small but gay group was collected round the door of the villa , as her litter passed by it to the private entrance of the baths appropriated to the women said one of the bystanders said Sallust continued Clodius Dismissing her slaves to that part of the house set apart for their entertainment , Julia entered the baths with Nydia , and declining the offers of the attendants , passed by a private door into the garden behind said one of the slaves said a superintendent , sourly Julia and Nydia , avoiding the more public part of the garden , arrived at the place specified by the Egyptian .
