# text = The warrior sauntered up to the ladies said he returned Fulvia , hastening to appropriate the compliment specially to herself replied the warrior , playing with a short chain which hung round the neck like a collar , instead of descending to the breast , according to the fashion of the peaceful said Julia said the wife of Pansa cried the poet , joining the group said the stately warrior , scanning the small form of the poet with ineffable disdain returned the poet , with a significant glance at the women I know no general from Mantua , said the warrior , gravely said Julia , laughing said the poet , a little alarmed whispered Sallust to Julia
