# text = This apparition , removed but by a cord from one's pericranium , and indulging the most vehement leaps , apparently with the intention of alighting upon that cerebral region , would probably be regarded with some terror by a party in May Fair ; but our Pompeian revellers seemed to behold the spectacle with delighted curiosity , and applauded in proportion as the dancer appeared with the most difficulty to miss falling upon the head of whatever guest he particularly selected to dance above .
