# text = And behind the bier followed , amidst her women , the sole surviving relative of the dead -- her head bare , her locks disheveled , her face paler than marble , but composed and still , save ever and anon , as some tender thought -- awakened by the music , flashed upon the dark lethargy of woe , she covered that countenance with her hands , and sobbed unseen ; for hers were not the noisy sorrow , the shrill lament , the ungoverned gesture , which characterized those who honored less faithfully .
