# text = The sister gazed , and not a sound was heard amidst the crowd ; there was something terrible , yet softening , also , in the silence ; and when it broke , it broke sudden and abrupt -- it broke , with a loud and passionate cry -- the vent of long-smothered despair cried the poor orphan , falling upon the couch The sound of her piercing voice aroused the sympathy of the mourners , and they broke into loud and rude lament .
