# text = Questioning her maidens , who had hitherto -- kindly anxious , as I have said , to save her the additional agony -- refrained from informing her of the state of Glaucus , she learned that he had been dangerously ill : that he was in custody , under the roof of Sallust ; that the day of his trial was appointed she exclaimed Instinctively she hastened her pace , confused and bewildered , scarce knowing whither she went ; now designing first to seek the praetor , and now to rush to the chamber of Glaucus .
