# text = As for the Atheist , said Clodius A peal of laughter announced the ridicule of the question said the host ; I to lose a friend is something ; but to find no one to bet on the chance of his escape is a worse misfortune to thee said the grave Pansa said Pansa , with a generous air observed Lepidus , it would have been assuredly dangerous to have been merciful at the eve of a beast-fight .
