# text = She carefully wound round the epistle the thread , and covered its knot with wax ; and ere she placed it in the hands of Sosia , she thus addressed him With this Sosia withdrew , carefully passing the heavy bolt athwart Nydia's door -- carefully locking its wards : and , hanging the key to his girdle , he retired to his own den , enveloped himself from head to foot in a huge disguising cloak , and slipped out by the back way undisturbed and unseen .
