# text = Only to the right and left extremities of the cavern , the space between the pillars was left bare , and the apertures stretched away into galleries -- not wholly dark , but dimly lighted by wandering and erratic fires , that , meteor-like , now crept ( as the snake creeps ) along the rugged and dank soil ; and now leaped fiercely to and fro , darting across the vast gloom in wild gambols -- suddenly disappearing , and as suddenly bursting into tenfold brilliancy and power .
