# text = He turned in fear towards the opposite extremity -- and behold ! there came swiftly , from the gloom above , similar shadows , which swept hurriedly along the gallery to the right , as if borne involuntarily adown the sides of some invisible stream ; and the faces of these spectres were more distinct than those that emerged from the opposite passage ; and on some was joy , and on others sorrow -- some were vivid with expectation and hope , some unutterably dejected by awe and horror .
