# text = Owing either to some inexperience on the part of the workmen , or to some defect in the machinery , the awning , however , was not arranged that day so happily as usual ; indeed , from the immense space of the circumference , the task was always one of great difficulty and art -- so much so , that it could seldom be adventured in rough or windy weather .
