# text = The two horsemen were now at either extremity of the lists ( if so they might be called ); and , at a given signal from Pansa , the combatants started simultaneously as in full collision , each advancing his round buckler , each poising on high his light yet sturdy javelin ; but just when within three paces of his opponent , the steed of Berbix suddenly halted , wheeled round , and , as Nobilior was borne rapidly by , his antagonist spurred upon him .
