# text = A very few blows , successfully and scientifically planted , might suffice to bring the contest to a close ; and the battle did not , therefore , often allow full scope for the energy , fortitude and dogged perseverance , that we technically style pluck , which not unusually wins the day against superior science , and which heightens to so painful a delight the interest in the battle and the sympathy for the brave growled Tetraides , moving nearer and nearer to his foe , who rather shifted round him than receded .
