# text = To add to this partial relief of the darkness , the citizens had , here and there , in the more public places , such as the porticoes of temples and the entrances to the forum , endeavored to place rows of torches ; but these rarely continued long ; the showers and the winds extinguished them , and the sudden darkness into which their sudden birth was converted had something in it doubly terrible and doubly impressing on the impotence of human hopes , the lesson of despair .
